<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>
	<!-- Glitterworld guns. Only Empire pawns, high-tier traders and quest rewards provide them. With Beyond Our Reach they stay craftable as a parallel line to Solar: plasteel, very high research cost, no BOR research. Without it they cannot be crafted. -->
